sequenceDiagram
    participant GUI as GUI thread
    participant Worker as Worker.run<br/>(QThread)
    participant Child as Owned analysis<br/>process(es)
    GUI->>GUI: Snapshot settings, create run,<br/>clear prior result views
    GUI->>Worker: Connect signals, then start
    Worker->>Child: run_isolated_analysis
    Child->>Child: Prepare inputs and<br/>run official processing
    Child-->>Worker: Logs, progress and results
    Worker-->>GUI: completed(results)
    GUI->>GUI: Prepare presentation data<br/>and install results
    Worker-->>GUI: finished: restore controls<br/>and release worker
